# pc64e7v6only - E7.7 native-only IPv6 without executable IPv4/ARP.
#
# Same boot/disk/console devices as pc64e7native, but ip.c/iproute.c are
# replaced by ip6only.c/iproute6.c and tcp.c/icmp.c are not linked.  The
# compiled V4 branches in ipifc.c/arp.c/udp.c/ipaux.c/loopbackmedium.c are
# selected out with -DE7_IPV6_ONLY.  NORMAL IPv6, NDP, UDP6 and the E7.4
# experimental Next Header 253 path remain.
#
# This is a test-only native profile; ordinary pc64/e71/e72/e73 are unchanged.
